    "title": "Human remains found in Claiborne County identified; no foul play found - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jas N Smith ,\n12 hours ago CLAIBORNE COUNTY, Miss. (WLBT) — After human remains were discovered in a wooded area of Claiborne County in March, authorities have identified the remains and determined that no foul play was involved in the death. The Claiborne County Sheriff’s Office said the remains were those of Elbert Campbell. Read full article\n3",
